00:05:12.526 --> 00:05:14.475
in their 20s, 30s, 40s.

00:05:14.475 --> 00:05:17.655
I'm so impressed with the healthiness that

00:05:17.655 --> 00:05:21.474
the US health culture has
exploded over the last decade,

00:05:21.474 --> 00:05:23.553
